pavel.halavan: I see, so when we start pinging vehicle we don’t stop until we explicitly press stop:
```const vehicleRingingEpic: Epic&lt;AnyAction, RingVehicleActions&gt; = (action$: Observable&lt;AnyAction&gt;) =&gt;
  action$.pipe(
    ofType(startRingVehicleAction),
    switchMap((action) =&gt; {
      return timer(0, config.vehicleRingingInterval).pipe(
        switchMap&lt;number, Observable&lt;any&gt;&gt;(() =&gt; {
          debugLog('Ring Vehicle');
          const { payload } = action;
          return of(ringVehicleAction(payload));
        }),
        takeUntil(action$.pipe(ofType(VehicleActionTypes.STOP_RINGING_VEHICLE))),
      );
    }),
  );```

