Workflow for the project (discussed with Albert on 16.10.2023):

1. Make a very thorough research with clear data - mostly TRT, ticket examples, and clear step-by-step existing workflow. Be ready to face all the challenging questions from the stakeholders.

2. Have a meeting with the representative of that department + SME from Business (Albert or BSS):
- Challenge each dependency;
- Have a clear list of what could and could not be changed and should be always escalated;
-  Set the SLOs and ask if it’s possible to set an automatic trigger for breaching an SLO.

3. Make changes to the existing article + add the list of cases where the escalation is a must for the Business Escalations Guidelines article;

4. Albert to ask his team to monitor the SLO accuracy and hold the team accountable in case of a breach.

